---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/+$/, "");
---
<Layout title="About — SolScape Retreats" description="SolScape was built by Nada and Samantha — two women who couldn't find the retreat they were looking for, so they made it themselves.">

  <!-- HERO -->
  <div class="detail-hero" style="min-height: 60vh;">
    <div class="hero-bg" style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1920&q=80');"></div>
    <div class="hero-overlay"></div>
    <div class="hero-content">
      <p class="sub">Our Story</p>
      <h1>Retreats rooted in movement,<br><em>beauty and intentional living</em></h1>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- BRAND STORY -->
  <section class="brand-story">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="story-grid">
        <div class="story-img" style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1545389336-cf090694435e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80'); background-size: cover; background-position: center top;"></div>
        <div class="story-text">
          <p class="section-label">How It Started</p>
          <h2 class="section-title">Rooted in movement. Shaped by experience. <em>Built with intention.</em></h2>
          <div class="divider"></div>
          <p>SolScape began through two different paths that slowly met in the same place.</p>
          <p>Samantha is known for her integrative approach to yoga, rooted in over three decades of study and teaching in philosophy, somatic awareness, movement as medicine, and embodied exploration. Her background in rhythmic gymnastics, along with her own experiences of recovery and healing, has deeply shaped her work.</p>
          <p>Nada came from a lifelong background in movement through ballet, fitness, and strength training, eventually expanding that journey into a broader exploration of wellness, balance, and what movement can become through different stages of life.</p>
          <p>What brought them together was a shared appreciation for retreats that feel both grounding and intentional — experiences where movement, environment, and meaningful connection come together naturally.</p>
          <p>Together, they began creating the kinds of retreats they themselves are drawn to: thoughtfully curated experiences rooted in movement, held within beautiful settings that encourage presence, rest, clarity, and reconnection.</p>
          <p>Over the past three years, SolScape has moved through Egypt, Greece, Tuscany, and Spain — with each retreat shaping the next chapter of what the experience continues to become.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PHILOSOPHY -->
  <section style="background: var(--charcoal); padding: 88px 0;">
    <div class="container" style="max-width: 820px; text-align: center;">
      <p class="section-label" style="color: var(--terra);">Our Philosophy</p>
      <blockquote style="font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.1rem); font-style: italic; color: var(--cream); line-height: 1.65; margin: 28px 0;">"Welcome to SolScape Retreats — where movement, adventure, and soulful living come together."</blockquote>
      <div class="divider" style="margin: 28px auto; background: var(--terra); opacity: 0.45;"></div>
      <p style="font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.95; color: var(--sand); margin-bottom: 20px;">We create retreats shaped by movement, beautiful surroundings and meaningful experiences – thoughtfully designed to help people slow down, reconnect and experience something that stays with them long after they've returned home.</p>
      <p style="font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 1.15rem; font-style: italic; color: var(--terra); letter-spacing: 0.04em;">Rooted in movement, depth and intention.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- TEAM -->
  <section class="team-section">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="section-label">The Founders</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">Meet <em>Nada &amp; Samantha</em></h2>
      <div class="team-grid">

        <div class="team-card">
          <img src={`${base}/images/team/samantha-hosts.jpg`} class="team-photo samantha-photo" alt="Samantha — Founder, One Yoga Academy">
          <div class="team-card-body">
            <h3>Samantha</h3>
            <p class="team-role">Founder of One Yoga Academy | Integrative Yoga &amp; Mind–Body Educator</p>
            <p>Samantha is the founder of One Yoga Academy and an integrative mind–body educator whose work is rooted in over three decades of immersive practice, study, and teaching.</p>
            <p>With a background spanning rhythmic gymnastics, yoga philosophy, contemplative inquiry, somatic exploration, and transpersonal psychology, her approach blends movement, breath, and embodied awareness into practices that support presence, healing, and deeper connection to self.</p>
            <p>Alongside a Master's degree in Fine Art and Sculpture, Samantha's teaching is shaped by both structure and creativity — guiding people beyond prescribed forms and into a more intuitive and lived relationship with the body, mind, and inner experience.</p>
            <p>Through SolScape, she shares thoughtfully curated retreat experiences alongside her dear friend Nada, bringing together their complementary strengths and shared love for meaningful connection, beauty, presence, and experiences that leave a lasting imprint long after the retreat ends.</p>
            <a href="https://www.instagram.com/oneyogasamantha/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@oneyogasamantha</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="team-card">
          <img src={`${base}/images/team/nada-hosts.jpg`} class="team-photo" alt="Nada — Barre Instructor &amp; Co-Founder">
          <div class="team-card-body">
            <h3>Nada</h3>
            <p class="team-role">Barre Instructor &amp; Movement Educator</p>
            <p>Nada brings together years of movement practice, creativity, and a deep interest in how women move, evolve, and reconnect with themselves throughout different stages of life.</p>
            <p>From ballet and strength training to barre and women's fitness, her teaching is grounded, encouraging, and energizing — focused on helping women feel strong, capable, and comfortable in their own bodies.</p>
            <p>Through SolScape, Nada helps create retreats centered around movement, beautiful surroundings, shared experiences and the kind of atmosphere where people feel genuinely welcomed and cared for.</p>
            <a href="https://www.instagram.com/forbarre/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@forbarre</a>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- VALUES -->
  <section class="values-section">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="section-label">What We Stand For</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">Three things we'll <em>never compromise</em></h2>
      <div class="values-grid">
        <div class="value-tile">
          <h4>Movement</h4>
          <p>Practices including yoga, barre, breathwork, and mindful exploration — thoughtfully designed to support strength, balance, and restoration.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-tile">
          <h4>Community</h4>
          <p>Shared movement, meaningful experiences, and the kind of connection that continues long after the retreat ends.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-tile">
          <h4>Sustainability</h4>
          <p>A slower, more intentional way of traveling — rooted in respect for place, people, culture, and the landscapes that host us.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="cta-band">
    <h2>Ready to <em>join us?</em></h2>
    <p>Have a question, or want to know more before committing? We'd love to hear from you.</p>
    <div style="display:flex; gap:16px; justify-content:center; flex-wrap:wrap;">
      <a href={`${base}/retreats/greece`} class="btn btn-primary">View Greece 2026</a>
      <a href={`${base}/contact`} class="btn btn-outline">Get in Touch</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
